      "source": "It provides default implementations for the\n<a href=\"#adviseCall(org.springframework.ai.chat.client.ChatClientRequest,org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api.CallAdvisorChain)\"><code>adviseCall(ChatClientRequest, CallAdvisorChain)</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#adviseStream(org.springframework.ai.chat.client.ChatClientRequest,org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api.StreamAdvisorChain)\"><code>adviseStream(ChatClientRequest, StreamAdvisorChain)</code></a> methods, delegating the\nactual logic to the <a href=\"#before(org.springframework.ai.chat.client.ChatClientRequest,org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api.AdvisorChain)\"><code>before(ChatClientRequest, AdvisorChain advisorChain)</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#after(org.springframework.ai.chat.client.ChatClientResponse,org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api.AdvisorChain)\"><code>after(ChatClientResponse, AdvisorChain advisorChain)</code></a> methods.",
